scription": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l2DNON4rVMYQ7kNvwGYOCTR&_nc_oc=AdnYW41oc_o5AsVGtLP3f0lb-4tCux4rmCq-PXUk-4aHO0e_7Ug-N_B13p53Nw9PdJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfviwYszW5LTAZAehaCx9EFBK5A11aD9xgS8PnTvvgRWRw&oe=6999B909"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z63zp0dsAbUQ7kNvwEoAyk3&_nc_oc=AdknXC9BEGKu204eto8aAg5DrbhlhH46J8VcEGL4vBSsys85DlwzXeWTpXgfIuhHKkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftScZQgWqGj2D7eKcY_jiE0VZwlkDDxP76LJlgbeJDCJw&oe=6999B73D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031361_1498865310806544_8225324080290249197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xv2d0ABZpGEQ7kNvwEnXz9n&_nc_oc=AdlM7tsKKUkaIAV6AOSYih57UXEGCh-CMBXqZYspfRpCe5YCv7QXtsvUtYGU8OSX